  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridging support for HR and Administration for National Catholic J &amp; P Commission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The National Catholic Justice and Peace Commission propose this human resources bridging project to safeguard the running of its operations as long term sustainable solutions are sought.  The project goal is to ensure that the KEC &#x2013;CJPC office continues to run for the six months of February to July 2008. 

During this period CJPC will evaluate its current 2004 &#x2013; 2008 in order to better inform the next strategic plan (2009 &#x2013; 2013); and will roll out strategic plan for 2009 &#x2013; 2013 that will enable them to strengthen both their national and diocesan advocacy on present issues surrounding human rights and dignity, justice and peace.  This bridging project will help sustain CJPC in their intervention to the recent post electoral conflict situation in Kenya.  This period will also be used consult and follow-up with partners that the CJPC had already submitted different programme proposals.</narrative>
  </description>
